{"id":"wb-5-364","name":"屈子祠","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"屈子祠","text":"屈子祠，又名屈原庙，三闾庙，为祭祀战国时楚国大夫屈原神位之祠庙，位于湖南省汨罗市汨罗江畔的玉笥山麓，始建于汉代，现存建筑系清乾隆重建，是中国大陆现存纪念屈原的唯一古建筑，有“中华第一祠”之称。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%B1%88%E5%AD%90%E7%A5%A0","revisionId":88088545,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=88088545","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/24556b7986e0956c0049e548.jpg","title":"Qu_Yuan_Temple,_Yueyang,_Hunan,_China_2022060303.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Qu_Yuan_Temple,_Yueyang,_Hunan,_China_2022060303.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/e/e5/Qu_Yuan_Temple%2C_Yueyang%2C_Hunan%2C_China_2022060303.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Huangdan2060","license":"CC BY 3.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/3.0","caption":"​湖南省岳阳市汨罗市屈子祠镇屈子祠进出口。","width":320,"height":427}}